<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Halley — 부동산 매물 비교</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@300;500;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
    <script defer src="/js/app.js"></script>
    <script defer src="/js/vendor/alpine.min.js"></script>
    {{#kakaoJsKey}}
    <script src="https://dapi.kakao.com/v2/maps/sdk.js?appkey={{kakaoJsKey}}&autoload=false"></script>
    {{/kakaoJsKey}}
</head>
<body x-data="halley()" x-init="init()">

<div class="shell">
    <div class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-in">
            <a class="wordmark" href="/">Halley</a>
            <template x-if="session.authenticated">
                <nav class="nav">
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='list'}" @click="setView('list')">매물</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='itinerary'}" @click="setView('itinerary')">임장</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='users'}" x-show="session.role==='ADMIN'" @click="setView('users')">사용자</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='me'}" @click="setView('me')">프로필</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='weights'}" x-show="session.role==='ADMIN'" @click="setView('weights')">기준</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='settings'}" x-show="session.role==='ADMIN'" @click="setView('settings')">설정</button>
                    <span class="who"><b x-text="session.nickname"></b><span x-text="session.role==='ADMIN' ? ' · 관리자' : ''"></span></span>
                    <button class="btn btn-ghost" @click="logout()">로그아웃</button>
                </nav>
            </template>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="main-grid" :class="mobileTab">
        <div class="mobile-tabs">
            <button :class="{on: mobileTab==='map'}" @click="setMobileTab('map')">지도</button>
            <button :class="{on: mobileTab==='list'}" @click="setMobileTab('list')">리스트</button>
        </div>
        <section class="map-panel">
            <div id="map" class="map-canvas"></div>
            <div class="map-empty" x-show="!session.authenticated || session.mustChangePassword">
                <div class="empty-ic">◌</div>
                <h4>카카오맵 대기 중</h4>
                <p>로그인 후 매물 좌표가 마커로 표시됩니다.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="m2-panel" x-show="showM2" x-cloak>
                <button class="m2-close" @click="closeDetail()">×</button>
                <template x-if="detailItem">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="m2-name" x-text="detailItem.property.name"></h3>
                        <div class="m2-meta">
                            <span class="badge" :class="dealBadge(detailItem.property.dealType)" x-text="dealLabel(detailItem.property.dealType)"></span>
                            <span class="m2-price" x-text="fmtWon(detailItem.property.priceDeposit)"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="m2-rows">
                            <div class="m2-row"><span>총점</span><b x-text="fmtScore(detailItem.totalScore)"></b></div>
                            <div class="m2-row"><span>주소</span><b x-text="detailItem.property.addressRoad || detailItem.property.addressJibun || '-'"></b></div>
                            <div class="m2-row"><span>전용면적</span><b x-text="detailItem.property.areaExclusiveM2 ? detailItem.property.areaExclusiveM2 + '㎡' : '-'"></b></div>
                            <div class="m2-row"><span>층/총층</span><b x-text="detailItem.property.floorNo ? detailItem.property.floorNo + '/' + (detailItem.property.floorTotal || '?') + '층' : '-'"></b></div>
                            <div class="m2-row"><span>향</span><b x-text="detailItem.property.direction || '-'"></b></div>
                            <div class="m2-row"><span>준공</span><b x-text="detailItem.property.approvalYear || '-'"></b></div>
                            <div class="m2-row"><span>상태</span><b x-text="detailItem.property.listingStatus"></b></div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="m2-actions">
                            <button class="btn btn-sm" @click="openScoreModal(detailItem)">채점</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-sm" @click="openLoanModal(detailItem)">대출</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-sm" @click="openCheckLogs(detailItem)">이력</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-sm" @click="openRefModal(detailItem)">실거래</button>
                                        <button class="btn btn-sm" @click="openPhotoModal(detailItem)">사진</button>
                                        <button class="btn btn-sm" @click="openAgentModal(detailItem)">중개인</button>
                                        <button class="btn btn-sm" @click="openEditProperty(detailItem)">수정</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </template>
            </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="list-panel">
            <template x-if="session.authenticated && !session.mustChangePassword">
                <div>
                    <div x-show="view==='list'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">01</span><h2>매물</h2><span class="sec-sub" x-text="visibleProperties.length + '건'"></span>
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" @click="openAddMenu()">+ 매물 추가</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="deal-tabs">
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='ALL'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('ALL')">전체</button>
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='SALE'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('SALE')">매매</button>
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='JEONSE'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('JEONSE')">전세</button>
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='MONTHLY'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('MONTHLY')">월세</button>
                            <button class="sold-toggle" :class="{on: showSoldOut}" @click="toggleSoldOut()">판매완료 포함</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="property-list">
                            <template x-if="visibleProperties.length === 0">
                                <div class="empty">
                                    <div class="empty-ic">◌</div>
                                    <h4>아직 등록된 매물이 없습니다</h4>
                                    <p>네이버 매물 상세 텍스트를 붙여넣거나 직접 입력해 첫 매물을 등록해 보세요.</p>
                                    <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="openAddMenu()">+ 매물 추가</button>
                                </div>
                            </template>
                            <template x-for="r in visibleProperties" :key="r.property.id">
                                <article class="property-card" :class="{active: activePropertyId === r.property.id, sold: r.property.listingStatus==='SOLD_OUT'}"
                                         :id="'prop-' + r.property.id" @click="focusProperty(r)">
                                    <div class="property-card-header">
                                        <span class="property-card-name" x-text="r.property.name"></span>
                                        <span class="property-card-price" x-text="fmtWon(r.property.priceDeposit)"></span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="property-card-meta">
                                        <span class="badge" :class="dealBadge(r.property.dealType)" x-text="dealLabel(r.property.dealType)"></span>
                                        <span class="badge b-admin" x-show="r.property.isDraft">작성 중</span>
                                        <span class="badge b-off" x-show="r.property.listingStatus==='SOLD_OUT'">판매완료</span>
                                        <span x-text="r.property.addressRoad"></span>
                                        <span x-show="r.property.floorNo" x-text="r.property.floorNo + '층'"></span>
                                        <span x-show="r.property.areaExclusiveM2" x-text="r.property.areaExclusiveM2 + '㎡'"></span>
                                        <span class="score-pill" :class="r.totalScore != null && r.totalScore >= 50 ? 'score-high' : 'score-low'">
                                            <b x-text="fmtScore(r.totalScore)"></b><i>점</i>
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="property-card-actions" @click.stop>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openDetail(r)">상세</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" x-show="r.property.isDraft" @click="openPasteModal(r)">완성</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openCheckLogs(r)">이력</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openScoreModal(r)">채점</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openLoanModal(r)">대출</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openRefModal(r)">실거래</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openEditProperty(r)">수정</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link danger" @click="removeProperty(r)">삭제</button>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                            </template>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div x-show="view==='weights'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">03</span><h2>평가 기준·가중치</h2><span class="sec-sub" x-text="weights.length + '개'"></span></div>
                        <div class="card table-wrap">
                            <table>
                                <thead>
                                <tr><th>순위</th><th>기준</th><th>유형</th><th>가중치</th><th>이동</th></tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                <template x-for="(w, i) in weights" :key="w.criterionCode">
                                    <tr draggable="true" @dragstart="dragStartWeight(i)" @dragover.prevent="dragOverWeight(i)"
                                        @dragend="dragEndWeight()" :class="{dragging: _dragIndex === i}">
                                        <td class="num drag-handle" x-text="i + 1"></td>
                                        <td class="strong" x-text="w.name"></td>
                                        <td>
                                            <span class="badge" :class="w.scoringType==='AUTO' ? 'b-mem' : (w.scoringType==='HYBRID' ? 'b-jeonse' : 'b-admin')"
                                                  x-text="w.scoringType==='AUTO' ? '자동' : (w.scoringType==='HYBRID' ? '추정' : '수동')"></span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="num" x-text="w.weight"></td>
                                        <td>
                                            <button class="btn-link" @click="moveWeight(i, -1)" :disabled="i === 0">↑</button>
                                            <button class="btn-link" @click="moveWeight(i, 1)" :disabled="i === weights.length - 1">↓</button>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </template>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="saveWeights()" :disabled="loading">
                            <span x-text="loading ? '저장 중…' : '가중치 저장'"></span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <div x-show="view==='itinerary'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">05</span><h2>임장 플래너</h2><span class="sec-sub" x-text="itinProperties.length + '건 선택'"></span></div>
                        <div class="card itin-panel">
                            <div class="form-grid">
                                <label class="span2">출발지 주소
                                    <input type="text" x-model="itinStart.address" placeholder="우리집">
                                </label>
                                <label>위도
                                    <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="itinStart.lat" placeholder="37.5">
                                </label>
                                <label>경도
                                    <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="itinStart.lng" placeholder="126.9">
                                </label>
                                <label>이동수단
                                    <select x-model="itinMode">
                                        <option value="DRIVING">자가용</option>
                                        <option value="TRANSIT">대중교통</option>
                                    </select>
                                </label>
                                <label>시작시간
                                    <input type="time" x-model="itinWindowStart">
                                </label>
                                <label>체류(분)
                                    <input type="number" min="5" x-model="itinStay">
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="itin-props">
                                <template x-for="r in visibleProperties" :key="r.property.id">
                                    <label class="itin-check">
                                        <input type="checkbox" :checked="itinProperties.includes(r.property.id)"
                                               @change="toggleItineraryProperty(r.property.id)">
                                        <span x-text="r.property.name"></span>
                                        <small x-text="fmtWon(r.property.priceDeposit)"></small>
                                    </label>
                                </template>
                            </div>
                            <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
                            <div class="paste-actions">
                                <button class="btn" @click="optimizeItinerary()" :disabled="loading">경로 계산</button>
                                <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="savePlan()" :disabled="loading" x-show="itinResult && !itinPlan">계획 저장</button>
                                <button class="btn" @click="recomputePlan()" :disabled="loading" x-show="itinPlan">재계산</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <template x-if="itinResult && !itinPlan">
                            <div class="itin-result card">
                                <p class="itin-total">예상 이동시간 합계: <b x-text="itinResult.totalMinutes + '분'"></b></p>
                                <template x-for="(id, i) in itinResult.orderedPropertyIds" :key="id">
                                    <div class="itin-stop">
                                        <span class="itin-num" x-text="i + 1"></span>
                                        <span x-text="propertyName(id)"></span>
                                    </div>
                                </template>
                            </div>
                        </template>

                        <template x-if="itinPlan">
                            <div class="itin-result card">
                                <p class="itin-total">총 이동 <b x-text="(itinPlan?.totalMinutes ?? 0) + '분'"></b> · <b x-text="(itinPlan?.stops?.length ?? 0) + '곳'"></b></p>
                                <template x-for="s in (itinPlan?.stops || [])" :key="s.id">
                                    <label class="itin-stop" :class="{done: s.visited}">
                                        <span class="itin-num" x-text="s.stopOrder + 1"></span>
                                        <span class="itin-time" x-text="s.estimatedArrival"></span>
                                        <span x-text="propertyName(s.propertyId)"></span>
                                        <small x-text="s.travelMinutesFromPrev ? '이동 ' + s.travelMinutesFromPrev + '분' : '출발'"></small>
                                        <input type="checkbox" :checked="s.visited" @change="toggleItineraryStop(s.id, !s.visited)">
                                    </label>
                                </template>
                            </div>
                        </template>
                    </div>

                    <div x-show="view==='users'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">02</span><h2>사용자 관리</h2><span class="sec-sub" x-text="users.length + '명'"></span>
                            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" @click="openAddUser()">+ 사용자 추가</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card table-wrap">
                            <table>
                                <thead>
                                <tr><th>닉네임</th><th>이메일</th><th>역할</th><th>가용 예산</th><th>상태</th><th>관리</th></tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                <template x-for="u in users" :key="u.id">
                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="strong" x-text="u.nickname"></td>
                                        <td x-text="u.email"></td>
                                        <td><span class="badge" :class="u.role==='ADMIN' ? 'b-admin' : 'b-mem'" x-text="u.role==='ADMIN' ? '관리자' : '회원'"></span></td>
                                        <td class="num" x-text="fmtWon(u.availableBudget)"></td>
                                        <td><span class="badge" :class="u.enabled ? 'b-on' : 'b-off'" x-text="u.enabled ? '활성' : '비활성'"></span></td>
                                        <td>
                                            <button class="btn-link" @click="openEditUser(u)">수정</button>
                                            <button class="btn-link" @click="resetUserPassword(u)">비번 리셋</button>
                                            <button class="btn-link danger" @click="removeUser(u)">삭제</button>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </template>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card temp-pw" x-show="tempPassword" style="margin-top:14px;">
                            <p class="temp-pw-label">임시 비밀번호 (1회 표시)</p>
                            <p class="temp-pw-value" x-text="tempPassword"></p>
                            <button class="btn btn-ghost" @click="tempPassword = null">닫기</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div x-show="view==='me'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">06</span><h2>내 프로필</h2></div>
                        <template x-if="profile">
                            <div class="card profile-panel">
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>닉네임</span><b x-text="profile.nickname"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>이메일</span><b x-text="profile.email"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>역할</span><b x-text="profile.role === 'ADMIN' ? '관리자' : '회원'"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>가용 예산</span><b x-text="fmtWon(profile.availableBudget)"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>직장</span><b x-text="profile.workplaceName || '미설정'"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>직장 좌표</span><b x-text="(profile.workplaceLat != null ? profile.workplaceLat + ', ' + profile.workplaceLng : '미설정')"></b></div>
                            </div>
                        </template>
                         <template x-if="profile">
                         <div class="card profile-panel" style="margin-top:14px;">
                             <h4 class="profile-title">직장 위치 지정</h4>
                            <div class="form-grid">
                                <label class="span2">주소 검색
                                    <div class="workplace-search">
                                        <input type="text" x-model="workplaceQuery" placeholder="회사 주소 검색" @keyup.enter="searchWorkplace()">
                                        <button class="btn" @click="searchWorkplace()">검색</button>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                                <template x-if="workplaceResults.length > 0">
                                    <div class="workplace-results span2">
                                        <template x-for="(r, i) in workplaceResults" :key="i">
                                            <button class="workplace-result" @click="selectWorkplace(r)">
                                                <span x-text="r.addressName"></span>
                                                <small x-text="r.roadAddressName"></small>
                                            </button>
                                        </template>
                                    </div>
                                </template>
                                <label>직장명
                                    <input type="text" x-model="profile.workplaceName">
                                </label>
                                <label>위도/경도
                                    <div class="workplace-latlng">
                                        <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="profile.workplaceLat">
                                        <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="profile.workplaceLng">
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
                            <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="saveWorkplace()" :disabled="loading">직장 위치 저장</button>
                        </div>
                        </template>
                        <div class="card profile-panel" style="margin-top:14px;">
                            <h4 class="profile-title">비밀번호 변경</h4>
                            <button class="btn" @click="openChangePw()">비밀번호 변경</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div x-show="view==='settings'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">04</span><h2>시스템 설정</h2></div>
                        <template x-for="cat in ['BATCH', 'SCORING', 'LOAN']" :key="cat">
                            <div class="settings-section">
                                <h4 x-text="configCategoryLabel(cat)"></h4>
                                <div class="card table-wrap">
                                    <table>
                                        <thead><tr><th>항목</th><th>값</th></tr></thead>
                                        <tbody>
                                        <template x-for="s in settingsByCategory(cat)" :key="s.configKey">
                                            <tr>
                                                <td class="strong" x-text="s.description"></td>
                                                <td><input class="settings-input" type="text" x-model="settingsForm[s.configKey]"></td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </template>
                                        </tbody>
                                    </table>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </template>
                        <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="saveSettings()" :disabled="loading">설정 저장</button>

                        <div class="settings-section">
                            <h4>Slack 알림</h4>
                            <p class="settings-note">Slack 연동은 서버 환경변수(SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL)로 관리됩니다. 설정 화면에서는 테스트 발송만 제공합니다.</p>
                            <button class="btn" @click="testSlack()" :disabled="loading">테스트 메시지 발송</button>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section">
                            <h4>생존 확인 배치</h4>
                            <p class="settings-note">매일 09:00 스케줄로 자동 실행됩니다. 즉시 수동 실행하려면 아래 버튼을 누르세요.</p>
                            <button class="btn" @click="runListingCheck()" :disabled="loading">배치 수동 실행</button>
                        </div>

                        <div class="settings-section">
                            <h4>알림 이력</h4>
                            <div class="card table-wrap">
                                <table>
                                    <thead><tr><th>이벤트</th><th>매물</th><th>상태</th><th>오류</th><th>시간</th></tr></thead>
                                    <tbody>
                                    <template x-if="notifications.length === 0">
                                        <tr><td colspan="5" class="empty-cell">발송 이력이 없습니다</td></tr>
                                    </template>
                                    <template x-for="n in notifications" :key="n.id">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td x-text="n.eventType"></td>
                                            <td class="num" x-text="n.propertyId ?? '-'"></td>
                                            <td><span class="badge" :class="n.status==='SENT' ? 'b-on' : 'b-off'" x-text="n.status"></span></td>
                                            <td x-text="n.errorMessage || ''"></td>
                                            <td x-text="fmtTime(n.createdAt)"></td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </template>
                                    </tbody>
                                </table>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </template>
        </aside>
    </main>
</div>

